ely to enrolled participants and must not be shared."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Programme and payment information"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The website does not take payment directly. Programme scope, payment schedule, cancellation rights, refund arrangements and start dates are confirmed in writing before a PayPal invoice is accepted. No place is guaranteed until both parties confirm the arrangement."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Educational scope"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Coaching and study materials are educational and developmental. They are not medical, psychological, legal or financial advice and do not replace qualified professional care. Individual experiences and results vary."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Independent status and third-party resources"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Unleash Your Power is independent. References to The Master Key System, The Secret, Mr Master Key, Zoom, PayPal and email providers do not imply sponsorship or endorsement. External websites and services apply their own terms and privacy practices."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Testimonials"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Testimonials describe individual experiences and are not promises that another participant will achieve the same result. Testimonial wording and attribution should be published only with the participant's permission."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"legalActions","children":[["$","$L6",null,{"className":"primary","href":"/","children":"Return to the programme"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"secondary","href":"mailto:toslondon9@gmail.com","children":"Ask a privacy question"}]]}]]}]]}]
